# Photographs of real, identifiable people, kept locally for manual testing.
#
# Deliberately not published. This repository is public, and a face photograph
# is biometric data about somebody who did not agree to it being on the
# internet. Use your own images when running the CLI:
#   ./run.sh path/to/a.jpg path/to/b.jpg
face1.jpg
face2.jpg
face-1.jpg
*.jpeg

