# Internal design/plan docs from the original build.
#
# Left out of the public repo for two reasons: they carry a colleague's work
# email address, and they describe the first design ("The model is loaded per
# request, by design") which is no longer how this works — a doc that
# contradicts the code is worse than no doc. Publish them if you want, once
# both are fixed.
docs/
